{"schema_version":"2.0-rc1","issue_id":"SP001","research_profile":"THEMATIC","publication_profile":"LONGFORM_SPECIAL","package_id":"PKG-6-FRONTIER-SYNTHESIS","draft_version":"v2.0","status":"REVISED","basis":{"draft_package_sha256":"1df731001667487e8d4e6eb65d8f5cdf15709386db934100d02451ec9caac460","prompt_id":"article-drafting-v2","prompt_sha256":"b687313312a23025228c16c3f10cb68f669b910cd7215e41886d4dd91f44fe11"},"runner":{"provider":"OpenAI","model":"GPT-5.6 Sol","invocation":"interactive ChatGPT project revision; exact accepted Evidence/Architecture constrained","generated_at":"2026-08-27T23:42:00Z","run_reference":"SP001 Publication Preview r1 Human REQUEST_CHANGES revision r2"},"headline":"最終総括：2026年のfrontierで収束したのは「一つの中国モデル」ではなく、設計圧力だった","deck":"DeepSeek、Qwen、GLM、Kimiは同じ系譜へ統合されたのではない。長文脈、sparsity、reasoning/post-training、agentic execution、distribution/runtimeという共通圧力へ、異なるfamily strategyのまま応答した。","deck_attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","deck_evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:1785bf3f5c6f6444","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d005-01","subject_id":"deepseek-v4","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:afc0e0cae360c851","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d008-01","subject_id":"qwen3-8","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:ca3b54b826e87f12","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d012-01","subject_id":"glm-5","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:255541abbbc51258","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d016-01","subject_id":"kimi-k3","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}],"blocks":[{"block_id":"p6-heading-conclusion","block_type":"HEADING","text":"最終総括：2026年のfrontier構造をどう読むか","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"p6-plural-origin","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"この巻の出発点は、2026年の中国発open-weight frontierを一つの直系系譜へ畳み込まないことである。2022年のGLM-130B、2023年のBaichuan 2、2024年初頭のDeepSeek LLM、同年のQwen2は、異なる組織・設計課題・公開経路を持つ複数のanchorとして現れた。後年の収束を見てから過去を一つの勝者史へ書き換えるのではなく、このpluralな出発点を保持することが、各familyが何を競争力へ変えたのかを比較する前提になる。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:65713fcea4fed72a","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d009-01","subject_id":"glm-130b","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:1c44a6ef76242055","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d019-01","subject_id":"baichuan-2","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:dcc22d5fb97ef241","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d001-01","subject_id":"deepseek-llm","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:11ce8f2212731f9d","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d006-01","subject_id":"qwen2","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}]},{"block_id":"p6-heading-convergence","block_type":"HEADING","text":"収束したのはモデル名ではなく、設計圧力だった","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"p6-convergence-system","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"2026年の各endpointでは、長文脈、sparsityやactive-compute削減、reasoning/post-training、agentic execution、そして実際に配布・serveするruntimeまでが同じsystem designの中で扱われるようになった。DeepSeek V4は1M context、sparse/token-compression、thinking/non-thinking、agentic codingとAPI deploymentを束ね、GLM-5は744B total / 40B active、sparse attention、asynchronous RL、local-serving recipeを一体で示し、Kimi K3は2.8T open-weight native multimodal、sparse MoE、1M context、long-horizon coding/agentic focusを同じrelease lineへ集約する。共通項は単一benchmarkの順位ではなく、推論能力を長く・安く・実運用可能な形で使うためのsystem-level圧力である。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:1785bf3f5c6f6444","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d005-01","subject_id":"deepseek-v4","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:ca3b54b826e87f12","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d012-01","subject_id":"glm-5","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:255541abbbc51258","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d016-01","subject_id":"kimi-k3","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}]},{"block_id":"p6-convergence-distribution","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"Qwenは同じ圧力へ別の角度から応答した。Qwen2の時点でdense/MoEの広いmodel rangeにHugging Face / ModelScope、quantization、fine-tuning、deployment資源を組み合わせ、Qwen3.8ではopen-weight agent/coding/research lineとhub distributionを前面に置く。ここではdistributionは学習後の付帯作業ではなく、checkpointを取得し、用途へ適合させ、実行環境へ接続できるまでのdeveloper-facing surfaceそのものとして競争軸になっている。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:11ce8f2212731f9d","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d006-01","subject_id":"qwen2","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:afc0e0cae360c851","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d008-01","subject_id":"qwen3-8","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}]},{"block_id":"p6-heading-differences","block_type":"HEADING","text":"それでも残ったfamily固有の差","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"p6-differences-deepseek","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"DeepSeekのtrajectoryで際立つのは、foundation→効率設計→reasoning post-training→agentic endpointという転換の明瞭さである。DeepSeek-V2ではMoE・MLA・DeepSeekMoEと236B total / 21B activatedという設計がactive computationとattention/serving効率を前面に出し、R1ではR1-Zeroのlarge-scale RLと、その後のcold-start dataを含むmulti-stage trainingがreasoning能力の獲得工程を独立した競争軸へ押し上げた。V4はその二つを長文脈・thinking mode・agentic deploymentへ接続する。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:b4feee60c7b42d7e","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d002-01","subject_id":"deepseek-v2","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:815652c418eda76e","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d004-01","subject_id":"deepseek-r1","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:1785bf3f5c6f6444","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d005-01","subject_id":"deepseek-v4","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}]},{"block_id":"p6-differences-others","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"Qwenはmodel breadthとdistribution、GLMはarchitecture・RL infrastructure・servingをまとめるsystems engineering、Kimiはlong-context multimodal reasoningからnative multimodal agentic systemへ進む軸が強い。Kimi k1.5でlong-context・multimodality・RLを結び付けた後、K3では1M contextとsparse MoEがagentic workloadを支えるsystem propertyとして現れる。似た技術語が並んでも、何をfamily strategyの中心に置いてきたかは同一ではない。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:11ce8f2212731f9d","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d006-01","subject_id":"qwen2","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:afc0e0cae360c851","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d008-01","subject_id":"qwen3-8","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:ca3b54b826e87f12","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d012-01","subject_id":"glm-5","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:6d60bb1c725326d0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d013-01","subject_id":"kimi-k1-5","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:255541abbbc51258","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d016-01","subject_id":"kimi-k3","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}]},{"block_id":"p6-heading-open","block_type":"HEADING","text":"「open」は一つの条件ではない","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"p6-license-distribution","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"このecosystemを理解するうえで、公開の有無と利用条件を分ける必要がある。repositoryのcode license、checkpointごとのweight/model license、再配布や商用利用の条件、さらにtraining recipeまで再現できるかは別々の問いである。Qwen3.8、GLM-5、Kimi K3、DeepSeek V4のような2026 artifactについては、accepted Evidenceが確認できたrelease・distribution・technical claimだけを採用し、未解決のcheckpoint licenseやbenchmark comparabilityをfamily全体へ一般化しない。この境界を保つことで、「open-weightであること」と「同じopen-source条件であること」を混同せずに競争力を評価できる。","attribution_mode":"MIXED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:afc0e0cae360c851","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d008-01","subject_id":"qwen3-8","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:ca3b54b826e87f12","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d012-01","subject_id":"glm-5","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:255541abbbc51258","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d016-01","subject_id":"kimi-k3","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:1785bf3f5c6f6444","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d005-01","subject_id":"deepseek-v4","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:afc0e0cae360c851","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"lim-sp001-d008-01","subject_id":"qwen3-8","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:ca3b54b826e87f12","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"lim-sp001-d012-01","subject_id":"glm-5","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:255541abbbc51258","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"lim-sp001-d016-01","subject_id":"kimi-k3","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:1785bf3f5c6f6444","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"lim-sp001-d005-01","subject_id":"deepseek-v4","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}]},{"block_id":"p6-heading-frontier","block_type":"HEADING","text":"なぜ恒常的なfrontierになったのか","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"p6-frontier-answer","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"中国発open-weight ecosystemが2026年のfrontier competitionで恒常的な構成要素になった理由は、ある一つのmodelが常に首位だからではない。複数familyが、architectureの効率、reasoningのpost-training、long contextとmultimodality、agentic workload、hub distribution、local/API servingという異なる層で独立に改善を積み重ね、その成果を研究論文だけでなく利用可能なmodel artifactとdeveloper pathとして継続的に外へ出す構造を作ったからである。競争はparameter countやbenchmark scoreだけでは閉じず、「能力をどのartifactとして、どのruntimeまで届けるか」へ広がった。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:b4feee60c7b42d7e","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d002-01","subject_id":"deepseek-v2","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:815652c418eda76e","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d004-01","subject_id":"deepseek-r1","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:1785bf3f5c6f6444","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d005-01","subject_id":"deepseek-v4","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:11ce8f2212731f9d","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d006-01","subject_id":"qwen2","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:afc0e0cae360c851","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d008-01","subject_id":"qwen3-8","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:ca3b54b826e87f12","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d012-01","subject_id":"glm-5","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:6d60bb1c725326d0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d013-01","subject_id":"kimi-k1-5","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:255541abbbc51258","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d016-01","subject_id":"kimi-k3","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"}]},{"block_id":"p6-frontier-boundary","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"したがって、本巻が示す「収束」はinstitutional ancestryや直接的技術継承の証明ではなく、異なるfamilyが共通のsystem-level制約へ応答したというevidence-bound synthesisである。また各sourceのbenchmark条件・harness・versionが一致しない以上、2026 frontierを一つの横断league tableへ正規化しない。残る不確実性を残したままでも、architecture、post-training、distribution、servingの複数層が同時に競争領域になったこと自体は、前5節の一次資料から一貫して読み取れる。","attribution_mode":"MIXED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:1785bf3f5c6f6444","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d005-01","subject_id":"deepseek-v4","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:afc0e0cae360c851","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d008-01","subject_id":"qwen3-8","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP001:ca3b54b826e87f12","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-sp001-d012-01","subject_id":"glm-5","subject_role":"PRIMARY_SUBJECT"},